{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Version 1.1 Additions<br>If you want, you can now kill your enemies. Try engaging in a massacre against multiple foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game should be fun, not stressful. That's why there is no leveling system, skill tree, or point system in this game. Don't play hard to achieve your goal, just relax and create your own style of gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you play this game is entirely up to you. This game is not about killing enemies. The enemies are very strong and almost impossible to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to dodge your enemies gracefully and use various traps to make them suffer in a cool way. The core functions of this game are shooting and jumping. Therefore, the attack and evasion system is very simple. However, depending on how you use these functions, there are many different play styles possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have no idea how to play, check out YouTube videos and the videos in the game tips. However, I recommend that you do not refer to them and create your own style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies can see and hear you. If you get too close, they will notice you. Keep in mind that this detection ability of enemies can be a strength, but it can also be used as a weakness. Once an enemy spots you, they will chase you like crazy. If you leave their sight for a certain period of time, they will give up on chasing you. Try to shake off the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the back of your enemy's head, surprise them with an air attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be afraid to die in the game. Remember that the more you die, the more you learn. But avoid dying in the same style. Try different things and experience different deaths.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3585150?t=1748922058","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585150/d3509f8b0b2710fe410d400744092482f7cce332/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1748922058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585150/d02f3ad3f6bbef5d9308ddafc13f437ba435b87e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748922058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585150/d02f3ad3f6bbef5d9308ddafc13f437ba435b87e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1748922058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[1,4,5],"notes":"Just nudity. No sex. No self-harm, no drugs."},"demos":[{"appid":3705080,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Version 1.1 Additions<br>If you want, you can now kill your enemies. Try engaging in a massacre against multiple foes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Game should be fun, not stressful. That's why there is no leveling system, skill tree, or point system in this game. Don't play hard to achieve your goal, just relax and create your own style of gameplay. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How you play this game is entirely up to you. This game is not about killing enemies. The enemies are very strong and almost impossible to kill.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn how to dodge your enemies gracefully and use various traps to make them suffer in a cool way. The core functions of this game are shooting and jumping. Therefore, the attack and evasion system is very simple. However, depending on how you use these functions, there are many different play styles possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have no idea how to play, check out YouTube videos and the videos in the game tips. However, I recommend that you do not refer to them and create your own style. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemies can see and hear you. If you get too close, they will notice you. Keep in mind that this detection ability of enemies can be a strength, but it can also be used as a weakness. Once an enemy spots you, they will chase you like crazy. If you leave their sight for a certain period of time, they will give up on chasing you. Try to shake off the enemy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hit the back of your enemy's head, surprise them with an air attack. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't be afraid to die in the game. Remember that the more you die, the more you learn. But avoid dying in the same style. Try different things and experience different deaths.</p>","developers":["No Brain"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3585150/c478de928ebbdfe7532ef3ea12afd2dddb9a9386/header.jpg?t=1748922058","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3585150/984700932/b2daecb8d123cb7a902e8061e837146ec85b777f/1750461699/dash_av1.mpd?t=1748402541","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3585150/984700932/b2daecb8d123cb7a902e8061e837146ec85b777f/1750461699/dash_h264.mpd?t=1748402541","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3585150/984700932/b2daecb8d123cb7a902e8061e837146ec85b777f/1750461699/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1748402541","id":257146884,"name":"EnemyHordeMode","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257146884/e27fa422341ce369ed5edb95204cfcb604166e57/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1748402541"},{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3585150/87371